<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     11.00 /10.80   11.60 /11.40   12.20 /12.00</p>
<p> BPI		     11.125/11.00   11.50 /11.25   12.25 /11.95</p>
<p> Citibank		11.00 /10.75   11.375/11.125  11.75 /11.50</p>
<p> Metrobank	     11.20 /10.90   11.70 /11.45   12.30 /11.925</p>
<p> Multinational	 11.15 /11.00   11.70 /11.60   12.25 /12.00</p>
<p> Solidbank	     11.00 /10.75   11.90 /11.65   12.50 /12.25</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     11.15 /10.90   11.75 /11.50   12.20 /11.95</p>
